      "oa:hasSelector": [
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(i) A flight simulator or flight training device may be used to meet the flight review requirements of this section subject to the following conditions:\n\n(1) The flight simulator or flight training device must be used in accordance with an approved course conducted by a training center certificated under part 142 of this chapter."
