        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the applicant\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"scope_text\":\"When a flight simulator or flight training device is used to meet the flight review requirements of 14 CFR § 61.56\",\"summary\":\"When a flight simulator or flight training device is used to meet the flight review requirements of 14 CFR § 61.56, unless the flight review is undertaken in a flight simulator that is approved for landings, the applicant must meet the takeoff and landing requirements of § 61.57(a) or § 61.57(b) of this part.\"}",
