 flight review requirements of 14 CFR § 61.56, unless the flight review is undertaken in a flight simulator that is approved for landings, the applicant must meet the takeoff and landing requirements of § 61.57(a) or § 61.57(b) of this part.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
